final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_x4myr")
province = 65
blurb = "Depicts a snow-covered mountain, flanked by bridges on both sides, near the Kiso river (which flows through present-day Nagano, Gifu, Aichi, and Mie prefectures).

Hiroshige completed this design one year before his death as part of a set of three triptychs on the theme known as setsugetsuka (\"snow-moon-flowers\"). Snow is the theme here, while the moon and flowers are the theme of the other two triptychs. These late Hiroshige works often avoided focusing on human figures and instead focused purely on vast landscapes."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
